---
const brands = [
  { name: 'Skool', image: 'skool.png', wordmark: false },
  { name: 'Circle', image: 'circle.svg', wordmark: true },
  { name: 'Mighty Networks', image: 'mighty.svg', wordmark: false },
  { name: 'Discord', image: 'discord.svg', wordmark: true },
  { name: 'Discourse', image: 'discourse.svg', wordmark: true },
  { name: 'Slack', image: 'slack.svg', wordmark: false },
];
---
<div class="alternatives-marquee" data-logo-marquee aria-label="Alternative community platforms">
  <div class="alternatives-heading"><span class="small-label">AN OPEN-SOURCE ALTERNATIVE TO</span><button type="button" data-marquee-pause disabled aria-label="Pause scrolling logos" aria-pressed="false">Pause <span aria-hidden="true">Ⅱ</span></button></div>
  <div class="alternatives-window"><div class="alternatives-track">
    {[0, 1].map(copy => <ul class="alternatives-group" aria-hidden={copy === 1 ? 'true' : undefined}>{brands.map(brand => <li><img src={`/alternatives/${brand.image}`} alt={brand.wordmark && copy === 0 ? brand.name : ''} width={brand.wordmark ? 145 : 32} height="32" loading="eager" class:list={[brand.wordmark && 'brand-wordmark']} />{!brand.wordmark && <span>{brand.name}</span>}</li>)}</ul>)}
  </div></div>
  <p>Paid, free, and open-source platforms. Your community has another option.<br /><span>Names and marks belong to their owners. No affiliation or endorsement.</span></p>
</div>
